  "prose": "When NIFTYBEES closes above both its 20-day and 50-day SMAs while RSI-14 sits in the 50-70 range (currently 64.1, price +1.6% above SMA20 and +2.76% above SMA50), the resulting uptrend regime tends to persist rather than immediately reverse, and this can be tested as a trend-continuation rule.",
